\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overall Architecture of Rep-YOLO11s. The pipeline integrates: (1) Stem CoordConv ($[RGB, X, Y] \to 5\times 640\times 640$); (2) Multi-scale backbone (P1 Stem, P2--P4 C3k2, P5 SPPF+C2PSA); (3) PAN neck with Bi-Level Routing Attention (BRA) and RepConv; (4) Decoupled detection heads ($cv3, cv2$); and (5) Decoupled multi-task loss supervision with TAL, Focal-EIoU, and DFL.}}{2}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture_overview}{{1}{2}{}{figure.1}{}}
